Great,

Thank you so much for considering my offer.
I hope I can help. Let's see how that goes first.
However, also, please keep in mind that I work in a school for the blind
located in Manhattan, NY, USA., I actually teach Braille Music, I mean, I
know the Music Braille Code and I might help you with the musical syntax
issues of your program (spelling chord by intervals, not being able to
export notation bar-overbar notation, not being able to export 'braille
unicode patterns', etc).

Your software is by far the closest to the Dancing Dots suite, but you are
not making any obscene profit out of the blind community, this is what I
like the most of your project and it would be an honor to work with you!

Best,
Pablo

